You can put wands of teleportation in your bag of holding. The bag
won't suddenly teleport away from you, at least in vanilla. :-) I
would keep at least two such wands in main inventory though.

> Just about everything
> else(various attack wands, potions, scrolls) is in my BoH. I'm
> wondering if it was a mistake to put all the scrolls/wands/potions in
> my BoH, as I can't easily access anything in the bag now since I would
> have to drop it and then loot it(then the vampire will beat on me).

You don't have to drop and loot, you can just apply the bag to open it
(though that will still cost you a turn). The only time you'd need/
want to loot a BoH on the ground is if you find one in a bones pile,
in which case you'd want to uncurse it first if possible, or if
something curses your BoH and it suddenly becomes too heavy to carry.

